# Only server/, web/, deploy/docker/ and the runtime packages' sources (integrations/, go generate) go into the hub
# image (Dockerfile).
*
!server/
!web/
!deploy/docker/
!integrations/agent-sdk/
!integrations/dsh/
!integrations/paseo/
!integrations/pi/
!integrations/runtime-sdk/
# the extension SDK's wire types: server/go.mod replaces its module with ../sdk/go (Dockerfile)
!sdk/go/
integrations/**/node_modules/
server/bin/
server/internal/hub/webdist/*
!server/internal/hub/webdist/README.md
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
# A hub run from this folder: its secrets and data (docs/docker.md).
deploy/docker/.env
deploy/docker/data/
deploy/docker/postgres/
**/.DS_Store
